7.2  EVENT REGISTRATION FLOW

     Browse Events → View Details → Click Register
     → Fill Form → Pay (if required) → Receive QR Ticket
     → Check-in at Event

7.3  DONATION FLOW

     Browse Projects → View Progress → Click Donate
     → Enter Amount → Choose Payment Method
     → Complete Payment → Receive Receipt
     → See Updated Progress

7.4  MENTORSHIP FLOW

     Alumni registers as Mentor → Student/Alumni browses
     offers → Sends Request → Mentor accepts/rejects
     → Mentorship begins

