8. COMPONENT LIBRARY
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

8.1  BUTTONS

     Primary:   Solid blue background, white text
     Secondary: Outlined blue border, blue text
     Ghost:     No background, blue text
     Danger:    Red background, white text
     Sizes:     Small, Medium, Large

8.2  FORMS

     Text input       — label, placeholder, validation
     Dropdown         — searchable options
     Date picker      — calendar popup
     File upload      — drag-and-drop area
     Checkbox         — multi-select
     Radio            — single-select
     Textarea         — multi-line input

8.3  CARDS

     Profile card    — photo, name, year group
     Event card      — date, title, location
     Project card    — progress bar, target
     News card       — headline, date, image
     Business card   — logo, industry, location

8.4  NAVIGATION

     Header         — logo, links, user menu
     Breadcrumbs    — page hierarchy
     Pagination     — page numbers
     Tabs           — switch content
     Sidebar        — dashboard nav

8.5  FEEDBACK

     Toast          — temporary notification
     Modal          — dialog box
     Loading        — spinner or skeleton
     Empty state    — no-data message
     Error state    — error message with retry

